"私鑰存在於「~/.ssh/id_rsa」中，則它會被重複使用；否則，將在「network_api/.Flow/pvt_key」（「client_priv.pem」/「client_pub.pem」）中產生新的"
" RSA-2048 RSA對。交換的公鑰始終來源自私鑰，因此會自動選取旋轉的「~/.ssh」對。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:289
#: bdeb8a5071664cb5b8cac25e75248620
msgid ""
"A user-supplied keypair can be forced with ``is_custom_keys = "
