"while user-typed commands are processed in `interactive_mode`."
msgstr ""
"客戶端既支援使用者可以在控制台中鍵入的內建命令，也支援類似伺服器的命令擴充 "
"API。傳入伺服器指令的主要入口點是“handle_server_command”，而使用者輸入的指令在“interactive_mode”下處理。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:378
#: 39bc5b35a7b34c9c8f09cf3e9bbcfc41
msgid ""
"The client supports two modes of operation: interactive console input "
"(when ``is_input_command_in_console`` is ``True``) or programmatic "
"control (when it is ``False``)."
msgstr ""
"用戶端支援兩種操作模式：互動式控制台輸入（當 is_input_command_in_console 為 True 時）或程式控制（當為 "
"False 時）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:382
#: d7319c43aad040d8a87e623ce0f3af6b
msgid "Built-in client console commands (user-typed) include:"
msgstr "內建客戶端控制台指令（使用者輸入）包括："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:384
#: 899fc267a5204badb7cbfcb5cce9d257
msgid "``/quit``: sends a quit message to the server and closes the connection."
msgstr "``/quit``：向伺服器發送退出訊息並關閉連線。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:385
#: 00e3571e7b7045fda95a8add5c83919f
msgid "``/file <file_path>``: starts a file transfer from client to server."
msgstr "``/file <file_path>``：啟動從客戶端到伺服器的檔案傳輸。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:386
#: da1d722ca29f43e68ef7663080691790
msgid ""
"``/multiple_file <file1> <file2> ...``: sends multiple files from client "
"to server (each in its own thread, respecting the semaphore limit)."
msgstr ""
"``/multiple_file <file1> <file2> "
"...``：從客戶端發送多個檔案到伺服器（每個檔案在其自己的線程中，遵守信號量限制）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:388
#: 6ab7adb05ccf4497a159491bb16ba3e7
msgid ""
"``/file_folder <folder_path>``: sends an entire folder from client to "
